 <h3><u>Haan wo hai fatima</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Sayyada, tahera, raaziya, marziya..(2)<br> Haan wo hai fatima..(4)<br> <br> Naazil dil e rasool par..(2) jo mojiza hua<br> Haan wo hai fatima..(4)<br> <br> 1. Charkha jo kaatti hai to burti hai aasma<br> chakki jo peesti hai to chalta hai ye jahaan<br> yu haath kibriya ka batati hai jo sada<br> Haan wo hai fatima..(3)<br> <br> 2. Zehra ki azmato ko kya samjhega ye bashar<br> hasnain baagh e khuld ke sardaar hai magar<br> jannat hasan husain ki..(2) hai jiske zere paa<br> Haan wo hai fatima..(3)<br> <br> 3. Qanoon e kibriya hai ye is kayenat me<br> shauhar ka rizq likha hai zawja ke haath me<br> tehreer jiske haath me hai rizq e murtuza<br> Haan wo hai fatima..(3)<br> <br> 4. Tanzeem e kaynat me haider ke saath thi<br> mitti khameer hazrat e adam se jo bachi<br> jisne usi khameer se..(2) hawwa ko di jila<br> Haan wo hai fatima..(3)<br> <br> 5. Masoom ki hadees hai sab ko hai ye khabar<br> chawda naqab e noor hai khaliq ke noor par<br> pehla naqab jo hai rukhe kirdigaar ka<br> Haan wo hai fatima..(3)<br> <br> 6. Haq to yahi tha hota ta'arruf rasool se<br> rishte magar khuda ne ginaye batool se<br> jiske liye nizam e..(2) mashiyat badal gaya<br> Haan wo hai fatima..(3)<br> <br> 7. Ismat ka rabb ne paas yu rakha kitab me<br> aayat me bhi zikr kiya to hijaab me<br> qur'an me jiska naam bhi khul kar nahi liya<br> Haan wo hai fatima..(3)<br> <br> 8. Mangwa ke do libaase falak ikhteyaar se<br> jisne hasan husain ki khwahish ke waaste<br> aayaat lane wale ko..(2) darzi bana liya<br> Haan wo hai fatima..(3)<br> <br> 9. Akbar ko noor e aale mohd ki hai qasam<br> duniya me meer koi nahi usse mohtaram<br> wo jiske ehteraam me uth te ho mustafa<br> Haan wo hai fatima..(3)</p> 
